WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.739
Step 1. Find the file.

1.2
00:00:01.739 --> 00:00:06.136
Here you open a file in the File Preview, and play an audio file.

1.3
00:00:06.136 --> 00:00:11.373
Open the Files tab of the patient or the encounter, and find the file.

2.1
00:00:11.373 --> 00:00:15.610
Step 2. Open the file. Select View in the row of the file.

2.2
00:00:15.610 --> 00:00:21.110
Care opens the File Preview, with the name of the file and the upload date under

2.3
00:00:21.110 --> 00:00:22.366
Created On.

3.1
00:00:22.366 --> 00:00:25.285
Step 3. Use the preview controls.

3.2
00:00:25.285 --> 00:00:31.271
For an image, select Zoom In or Zoom Out, and Rotate Left or Rotate Right.

3.3
00:00:31.271 --> 00:00:35.573
Select Reset to undo the zoom and the rotation.

4.1
00:00:35.573 --> 00:00:37.789
Step 5. Move to another file.

4.2
00:00:37.789 --> 00:00:43.482
If the page of the list has more than one active file, the preview shows two arrows.

4.3
00:00:43.482 --> 00:00:47.303
Select one to open the previous or the next file.

5.1
00:00:47.303 --> 00:00:53.767
Step 6. Play an audio file. For an MP3 or WAV file, select Play in its row.

5.2
00:00:53.767 --> 00:01:00.564
Care opens the Play Audio dialog, with play and pause, a seek bar, and mute.
